IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ca14-penalty-unit`

-- Crimes Act 1914 s 4AA with the Crimes (Amount of a Penalty Unit) Instrument 2026 -- worked cases, from the seat of the
-- person charged with or convicted of a Commonwealth offence.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Expected values were written by hand
-- from the deposited texts (the Act, C2026C00368, s 4AA; the Instrument, F2026N00424, s 5), never copied from the encoding's
-- output. No scenario life raised this; the facts are the encoder's, HYPOTHETICAL throughout.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Instrument s 5 and s 4AA(8): an offence on or after 1 July 2026 -- $364. On the indexation day itself -- $364.
#ASSERT `What is a penalty unit worth for my offence` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS `worth in dollars` 364
#ASSERT `What is a penalty unit worth for my offence` (Date 1 7 2026) EQUALS `worth in dollars` 364
-- The last day before the next indexation day: still $364.
#ASSERT `What is a penalty unit worth for my offence` (Date 30 6 2029) EQUALS `worth in dollars` 364
-- s 4AA(8): an offence the day before 1 July 2026 keeps the $330 of s 4AA(1), even if sentenced later.
#ASSERT `What is a penalty unit worth for my offence` (Date 30 6 2026) EQUALS `worth in dollars` 330
-- The day the $330 commenced (7 November 2024): $330.
#ASSERT `What is a penalty unit worth for my offence` (Date 7 11 2024) EQUALS `worth in dollars` 330
-- Not covered: before the $330, and on or after the next indexation day.
#ASSERT `What is a penalty unit worth for my offence` (Date 6 11 2024) EQUALS `not covered: my offence was committed before 7 November 2024, and the amount of a penalty unit before the $330 of s 4AA(1) is not in the deposited text`
#ASSERT `What is a penalty unit worth for my offence` (Date 1 7 2029) EQUALS `not covered: my offence was committed on or after 1 July 2029, the next indexation day under s 4AA(3), and no instrument publishing that amount is deposited`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- HYPOTHETICAL: Priya is charged with an offence carrying 60 penalty units, committed on 14 September 2026: 60 x $364 = $21,840.
#ASSERT `What is my maximum penalty in dollars` (Date 14 9 2026) 60 EQUALS `worth in dollars` 21840
-- The same offence committed on 1 March 2026: 60 x $330 = $19,800.
#ASSERT `What is my maximum penalty in dollars` (Date 1 3 2026) 60 EQUALS `worth in dollars` 19800
-- An offence of 120 penalty units in 2030: not covered.
#ASSERT `What is my maximum penalty in dollars` (Date 1 1 2030) 120 EQUALS `not covered: my offence was committed on or after 1 July 2029, the next indexation day under s 4AA(3), and no instrument publishing that amount is deposited`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- s 20(5) in dollars. Sam's offence (committed 15 August 2026) is imprisonment only. In a magistrates court: 60 penalty units
-- = $21,840; in the District Court: 300 penalty units = $109,200.
#ASSERT `The most a s 20 recognizance can make me pay in dollars` (Date 15 8 2026) FALSE 0 TRUE EQUALS `worth in dollars` 21840
#ASSERT `The most a s 20 recognizance can make me pay in dollars` (Date 15 8 2026) FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS `worth in dollars` 109200
-- Committed 15 August 2025, in the District Court: 300 x $330 = $99,000.
#ASSERT `The most a s 20 recognizance can make me pay in dollars` (Date 15 8 2025) FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS `worth in dollars` 99000
-- An offence with a maximum fine of 120 penalty units, committed 15 August 2026: 120 x $364 = $43,680.
#ASSERT `The most a s 20 recognizance can make me pay in dollars` (Date 15 8 2026) TRUE 120 TRUE EQUALS `worth in dollars` 43680
-- Committed in 2024 before the $330 began: not covered.
#ASSERT `The most a s 20 recognizance can make me pay in dollars` (Date 1 6 2024) FALSE 0 TRUE EQUALS `not covered: my offence was committed before 7 November 2024, and the amount of a penalty unit before the $330 of s 4AA(1) is not in the deposited text`
